            "body": "This pull request has merge conflicts that must be resolved before it can be\nmerged. Please rebase the PR, @ekuznetsov139.\n\nhttps://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/collaborating-with-pull-requests/working-with-forks/syncing-a-fork\n",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-23T00:33:34Z",
