          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "frida-andersson"
            },
            "body": "The description still has the `SiluAndMulWithClamp` commit, and that commit is not in the diff. The numbers are also bs=1 on top of #39168. Could you rebase and rerun against main, same TP setup, at a couple of concurrencies besides 1, and at a shorter and a longer prompt than 32k? Could you also verify the accuracy with a GSM8K score and a RULER NIAH against the Triton-unfused arm on the same machine?",
