    "body": "This supplies two optimizations.\r\n\r\nCommit 377052e enables aiter Triton MXFP4 MoE on gfx942 (MI300/MI325). It is substantially faster than vllm's reference, but it is currently incorrectly gated for gfx950 only.\r\n\r\nCommit ee22950 restores compiled forward_native in SiluAndMulWithClamp for ROCm and XPU (compilation is currently being inadvertently disabled). This supplies a modest performance boost to all models using this layer.\r\n\r\nDecode throughput numbers (context 32768, bs=1, MI325, on top of PR #39168):\r\n\r\n| config | base | +MoE | +both |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| DS4-Pro TP4 | 22.39 | 46.49 | 50.19 (**2.24×**) |\r\n| DS4-Flash TP1 | 32.72 | — | 64.43 (**1.97×**) |\r\n",
